<clause id="_beb7a01a-1b62-c3f6-fcbe-142cb2015cfc" anchor="sec_4.4" obligation="normative">
<title id="_58cc1615-dba5-a15f-0c42-d00df3b52dab">Data coverage meta feature</title>
<p id="_088dfd03-42a9-5f4e-5d21-16424826b1fc"><strong>DataCoverage</strong>: In order to assist in data discovery, the meta feature <strong>DataCoverage</strong> must be used to provide the area of coverage of the S-123 dataset. This means that  <strong>DataCoverage</strong> expresses where the presence or absence of S-123 geographic features is asserted. Unlike S-101 datasets, there is no ‘skin of the earth’ principle in S-123 and there may be regions covered by a  <strong>DataCoverage</strong> but where no geographic S-123 feature is present.</p>

<table id="_2d1cb386-9a1b-ad56-82c4-837070b9253e" width="100%"><colgroup><col width="29%"/><col width="1%"/><col width="17%"/><col width="15%"/><col width="12%"/><col width="12%"/><col width="14%"/></colgroup><tbody><tr id="_4c788411-37e0-1412-0e04-d703994e6455"><td id="_9e4545ea-48b8-1a30-3151-0c9c3072f659" valign="top" align="left"><underline>IHO Definition:</underline> A geographical area that describes the coverage and extent of spatial objects.</td>
<td id="_8dbe2ebc-725d-407d-0394-5d6062fe4512" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_3bff237f-ee59-9b2b-fa03-46f2d22e38f1" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_2308f665-bb18-dff2-17a7-b00e91189dee" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_61c389a1-adea-9342-9628-92bbebbad3f5" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_70691e4b-9fe9-89b4-b93b-3a7f2f988789" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_dd3373ff-50fa-117b-fb9e-ebaaec50047a" valign="top" align="left"/></tr><tr id="_b0eceb37-87a6-84c2-0461-921400186558"><td id="_141a4097-dc2c-0180-a9bc-3932bbb57503" valign="top" align="left"><strong><underline>S-10x Metadata Feature:</underline> Data Coverage (M_COVR, M_CSCL)</strong></td>
<td id="_a720c616-7b78-0046-6c86-37ab82acad57" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_0799995e-ab00-202d-ec77-a0704e222ddf" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_c14c374a-615f-fd52-3f78-666f12e053ef" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_5969f32b-56ae-4eaa-d817-beda8d6528b9" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_b3affcdb-807e-1117-4f6b-f786a9c98967" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_7ac08029-6368-0888-760c-cf710d027c8e" valign="top" align="left"/></tr><tr id="_46d6b0b3-607d-3a80-dcbb-1663ead21f62"><td id="_ccd88010-0c74-6448-5d7e-3b216281b3bc" valign="top" align="left"><strong><underline>Super Type:</underline></strong></td>
