<title id="_226d5cd3-6450-f2ef-c63b-f1b483ac0860">GMDSS Area</title>
<table id="_31383086-e1c3-9b4d-106a-ab35930c838f" width="100%"><colgroup><col width="31%"/><col width="5%"/><col width="18%"/><col width="13%"/><col width="11%"/><col width="10%"/><col width="12%"/></colgroup><tbody><tr id="_787a7cde-d2d6-7c25-b0fe-3d9941cfa6d3"><td id="_6b28365d-f1b7-af62-c98d-a1a5a3616fff" valign="top" align="left"><underline>IHO Definition:</underline> An area defined for a global communications service based upon automated systems, both satellite based and terrestrial, to provide distress alerting and promulgation of maritime safety information for mariners.</td>
