<clause id="_45a8db9e-0441-4017-75fd-2dd94ae09a75" anchor="sec_5.4" obligation="normative">
<title id="_97364e8e-8885-7b17-6f09-85ab2f7f82d6">Indeterminate Zone</title>
<table id="_df3e0074-5417-c7d2-3497-b45148f79ad8" width="99%"><tbody><tr id="_4e632114-e62c-b0af-37ed-9ea28ca41a71"><td id="_89e3ba5d-4edf-efe1-7b62-bb9f3d208f1c" valign="top" align="left"><underline>IHO Definition:</underline> A region in which the perception of a phenomenon or the availability of a service is known only to a specified level of confidence.</td>
