<ul id="_95d2e955-90c0-6d0f-4a71-b75684d12ef9"><li><p id="_fa24de80-ae8f-d6a5-886d-1701fed3f484">Indeterminate Zone feature instances associated to the same aggregate feature instance must not overlap.</p>
</li>
</ul>

<p id="_f582e8ff-ed0c-9c0d-682b-f2bf4ae0dde1"><underline>Distinction:</underline></p>
