<clause id="_50d6436d-abf6-1b49-20b4-85ed82d1c720" anchor="sec_5.5" obligation="normative">
<title id="_0ff26ea2-79ab-adc6-a8d6-93dbb5786c1e">METAREA</title>
<table id="_95049f8f-8e57-2255-5698-ee4e5d3caf94" width="100%"><tbody><tr id="_2e31af90-0ffd-ff41-fece-179283e26530"><td id="_1b54c83c-8366-905a-a126-80c8639742a8" valign="top" align="left"><underline>IHO Definition:</underline> A geographical sea area (which may include inland seas, lakes and waterways navigable by seagoing ships) established for the purpose of coordinating the broadcast of marine meteorological information.</td>
<td id="_4b6d01b1-a522-1761-6152-9339c3263a44" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_64cac066-d3a1-fa7a-c1fc-738c8cb3d9f9" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_5dec28be-2a12-aa08-cd43-a77cc459ffd1" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_e136c358-55c9-09dd-0b32-d01fad1b9910" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_3e8165b1-9865-fa85-2dee-8c71888c7786" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_760d1701-0cf5-73f1-b3eb-6f2614ae3c02" valign="top" align="left"/></tr><tr id="_19cb30cd-b690-27b7-97ad-542015bc9a0c"><td id="_f08c9860-ddb9-19e9-7ca1-a0c66a143c3e" valign="top" align="left"><strong><underline>S-123 Geo Feature:</underline> METAREA</strong></td>
