<p id="_d0cc8144-e826-f728-d3ac-9b2417b30e8c"><underline>Remarks:</underline></p>

<p id="_96173d24-edc1-4232-6c49-eced8931e3d4">The term METAREA followed by a roman numeral and the extensions to uniquely identify a sub area, such as METAREA VIII(N) and METAREA VIII(S), is to be coded by using the  <strong>Feature Name</strong> attribute.</p>

<p id="_a867eb46-c577-0740-18d5-5dd2fdffee4b">Only the roman number is to be coded in the <strong>Id METAREA</strong> attribute.</p>

<p id="_039234b7-925d-2032-61b5-ea0898cc8470">The METAREA coordinator should be encoded as an associated <strong>Authority</strong>. The coordinating authority to be associated should be the issuing authority, not the preparation authority, of the METAREA.</p>

<p id="_e5599f7e-6c97-f324-2968-dc4684d5ec77"><underline>Distinction:</underline></p>
</td>
<td id="_f4d6c7ff-2694-c999-b450-d143802652cd" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_598018c7-4e11-6bfb-5cf2-b84b463a0043" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_2ba243e9-9fff-99ac-382e-f8cc5b47b9b6" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_1b7814f1-d72d-6bc5-fb99-ac32436c52c6" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_9ffffb9b-a237-9458-9ef1-39be547aaf77" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_d0d198ba-e1b5-5e63-21b9-658c4a6a32cb" valign="top" align="left"/></tr></tbody>
</table>

