<p id="_d8c2b848-2233-e9bd-d5ed-dd0a8b1c9963"><underline>Remarks:</underline></p>

<p id="_b0bac35f-dc65-c28c-f9ef-fcd98c2d17cc">The term NAVAREA followed by a roman numeral and the extensions to uniquely identify a sub area, such as NAVAREA I Baltic Sea sub-area, is to be coded by using the  <strong>Feature Name</strong> attribute. Only the roman number is to be coded in the  <strong>Id NAVAREA</strong> attribute.</p>

