<clause id="_1e890177-eefe-1b46-c51e-f2f3fa38bd76" anchor="sec_5.8" obligation="normative">
<title id="_49b10869-8a4e-64ec-db90-30ce95dda6d7">Radio Service Area</title>
<table id="_69b8e5b0-c5ba-a189-5443-14700ec0cef1" width="100%"><colgroup><col width="29%"/><col width="19%"/><col width="19%"/><col width="10%"/><col width="9%"/><col width="14%"/></colgroup><tbody><tr id="_0c27253e-a9a2-5220-7490-f60cb7ca050b"><td id="_36b765e3-6d96-cd00-a1ad-7426767e8650" valign="top" align="left"><underline>IHO Definition:</underline> The area where a radio service can be obtained and the characteristics of the radio transmission.</td>
