<p id="_d8460633-b64d-0769-4f72-a3c3256bc46f"><underline>Remarks:</underline></p>

<p id="_9bafd1f7-9b11-4017-b965-6ad1ce4cb195">Attributes should be encoded only if they apply to the collection of core feature and indeterminate zones. For example, if it is necessary to provide a note that applies to all the features collectively, it may be encoded in the inherited attribute  <strong>textContent</strong> of the <strong>RadioServiceAreaAggregate</strong>.</p>

<p id="_8cb52bd9-550f-492a-bcbc-4e2fd70628c2"><underline>Distinction:</underline></p>
</td>
