<table id="_b8f03106-8454-595d-d7df-230e63fc4b6e" width="100%"><tbody><tr id="_4469878c-648b-0a7a-86c9-8c78c802e44b"><td id="_6f8ff33e-ff93-e236-d574-37ddac90ca9f" valign="top" align="left"><underline>IHO Definition:</underline> Description of the content and schedule of a service using broadcast technology of radiocommunications to deliver information (to every receiver within a direct range). Online resource to access the content may also be included.</td>
