</clause>

<clause id="_a1ce1b74-9e4c-7e5f-d584-5d035ca356ea" anchor="sec_7.9" obligation="normative">
<title id="_19755fea-e316-5501-48a2-2096727f533b">Non-Standard Working Day</title>
<table id="_5e049a5f-b20a-1c7a-9bed-c75b852d7864" width="100%"><colgroup><col width="28%"/><col width="17%"/><col width="22%"/><col width="7%"/><col width="9%"/><col width="17%"/></colgroup><tbody><tr id="_e46de048-fd7b-2179-372a-859c63bd6e23"><td id="_e574627c-e143-a582-14f9-61d4a4eea606" valign="top" align="left"><underline>IHO Definition:</underline> Days when many services are not available. Often days of festivity or recreation or public holidays when normal working hours are limited, especially a national or religious festival, etc.</td>
