<p id="_d55db4e1-5808-e8d2-291c-00ddef0c517d"><strong>Regulations</strong> is intended to be used for official rules, laws, and similar source material, i.e., sources that have the force of law or are mandated by a controlling authority. They will generally originate from some kind of administration or authority.</p>

