<p id="_b657ca60-dce0-3c61-e7cf-f887ad0f7645"><strong>Restrictions</strong> is intended for restrictions that constrain the activities of vessels temporarily with or without the legal force, or for longer terms without the force of law; they may be issued by a local authority.</p>

