<td id="_37c80c4c-46fb-a68b-df81-8c3c026887df" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_d09def3a-8e99-399c-6a3d-42734f03e2ff" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_78075367-bd68-ef53-7001-23dd84a6e59e" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_0dcbe2f6-fe5d-293b-7656-a3a66be29b94" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_d2f917f9-bb21-1331-37e8-9a66d69ffd59" valign="top" align="left">(S) TE</td>
<td id="_927ff79f-f716-60f4-649b-c72affcf7ade" valign="top" align="left">0, 1</td>
</tr><tr id="_71bfdbf5-21aa-fe99-bd9c-4bdf6126ef2e"><td id="_8252e63c-3f1a-3d0a-127a-2dd53b13afe8" valign="top" align="left"><p id="_63d73f54-4423-5ad8-66b6-e6b1ecdceb61"><underline>INT 1 Reference:</underline></p>

<p id="_28b9ad14-fd3d-706a-4125-c83812f3d482"><underline>Remarks:</underline></p>

<ul id="_8b10d194-f421-76c1-8b0c-c1abc97198fa"><li><p id="_86217d53-6cdb-9971-880c-e4ec040d5e6e">For the <strong>Hours of Watch</strong> attribute, the hours are given in UTC or by using a service symbol. Examples from ITU List IV: “0000-0030 0730-0800”, “H24” ( “H24” means a continuous service).</p>
</li>
<li><p id="_4ec82522-fa1d-7d77-2442-001903bdd922">To encode <strong>Hours of Watch</strong> by using service symbols, one of the following defined in ITU List IV should be used:</p>
</li>
</ul>

<quote id="_d14db3b6-b6d2-f5a1-74b9-3b2a5bb9edbd"><p id="_6e5f4165-49c6-25c0-9cff-1120268cc5ab">“H24” means continuous service throughout the twenty-four hours;</p>

<p id="_5b1b3914-4fc5-81f5-a3c9-074244ce4458">“HX” means intermittent service throughout the twenty-four hours, or station having no specific working hours;</p>

<p id="_fcf378c5-7f9c-abcb-4c8b-750c8f9ff330">“HJ” means day service;</p>

<p id="_962b0933-2219-f922-1157-addbee3c3ed4">“HN” means night service.</p>
</quote>

<ul id="_b8afcc2e-ab10-322e-1184-ba2f59e8522f"><li><p id="_d08ee511-289c-2850-8d55-1349285175b4">The Hours of Watch attribute is of text type. If it is required that the hours be given in local time, it should be clearly indicated, e.g., by appending “Local Time (LT) “</p>
</li>
</ul>

<p id="_d9c59270-9a19-f13b-be46-c4b6e447f8e5"><underline>Distinction:</underline></p>
</td>
<td id="_5770f655-0e8a-dcfd-1317-f5a2f6468eaf" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_09276337-16ee-66f8-2f8c-63d33ee6d161" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_62168fd0-cbab-b862-4670-a57f9b7405e9" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_52229079-17a8-a07a-2ffb-16ff759729c5" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_3c5db46d-37f6-581f-bf70-a29d214cff40" valign="top" align="left"/><td id="_187d8d55-329a-a47a-1a5a-3bb383ccd527" valign="top" align="left"/></tr></tbody>
</table>

